<v Man>[嘈杂声]

00:34:39.150 --> 00:34:43.100
<v Man>That's all I can say, is I'm proud. We're really proud of you.
<v Man>我只能说，我感到骄傲。我们真的为你感到骄傲。

00:34:43.100 --> 00:34:47.890
<v Firefighter>You guys have put us up and made us feel right at home here, very nice of you.
<v Firefighter>你们让我们住在这里，让我们感觉像在自己家一样，你们太好了。

00:34:47.890 --> 00:34:52.590
<v Man>We're just proud of you, is all I can say. That's all I can say.
<v Man>我只能说，我们为你感到骄傲。我只能说这些。

00:34:52.590 --> 00:34:53.480
<v Firefighter>Thank you, sir.
<v Firefighter>谢谢你，先生。

00:34:53.480 --> 00:35:09.160
<v Man>That's all I can tell you is, we're proud of you guys. Y'all did a hell of a job, and we're proud of you, that's all I can say. We're really proud of you. Y'all did a hell of a job, and that's all I can say, bud.
<v Man>我只能告诉你，我们为你们感到骄傲。你们干得好，我们为你感到骄傲，这就是我能说的。我们真的为你感到骄傲。你们干得好，这就是我能说的，伙计。

00:35:09.160 --> 00:35:24.790
<v Sal Princiatta>We're his connection. We're his connection to what went down. And that's it. We connect him to what went down. And we give him a vehicle to feel it.
<v Sal Princiatta>我们是他的联系。我们是他与发生过的事情的联系。就是这样。我们把他与发生过的事情联系起来。我们给他一个感受它的载体。

00:35:24.790 --> 00:35:25.670
<v Man>Whereas for you--
<v Man>而对于你——

00:35:25.670 --> 00:35:41.570
<v Sal Princiatta>Exactly. As for us, we're too connected? No [BLEEP]. Very much too connected.
<v Sal Princiatta>没错。至于我们，我们联系太紧密了？见鬼的。真的太紧密了。

00:35:41.570 --> 00:35:49.200
<v Sal Princiatta>There was one day we played a softball game against Memphis Fire Department.
<v Sal Princiatta>有一天我们和孟菲斯消防局打了一场垒球比赛。

00:35:49.200 --> 00:35:52.620
<v Woman>Way to go, Sal. Way to come home.
<v Woman>干得好，萨尔。欢迎回家。

00:35:52.620 --> 00:35:53.460
<v Sal Princiatta>[BLEEP].
<v Sal Princiatta>[脏话]。

00:35:53.460 --> 00:35:53.780
<v Man>All right, whose--
<v Man>好了，谁的——

00:35:53.780 --> 00:35:55.190
<v Sal Princiatta>Mine.
<v Sal Princiatta>我的。

00:35:55.190 --> 00:35:56.610
<v Man>You all right?
<v Man>你还好吗？

00:35:56.610 --> 00:35:57.080
<v Sal Princiatta>Yeah.
<v Sal Princiatta>是啊。

00:35:57.080 --> 00:35:58.810
<v Man>Want me to go get the bottle?
<v Man>要我去拿瓶子吗？

00:35:58.810 --> 00:36:00.660
<v Man>He's now a paramedic?
<v Man>他现在是护理人员了？

00:36:00.660 --> 00:36:05.930
<v Sal Princiatta>Something.
<v Sal Princiatta>差不多。

00:36:05.930 --> 00:36:09.330
<v Sal Princiatta>[SOUND OF INHALER]
<v Sal Princiatta>[吸入器的声音]

