<v Ira Glass>[资助名单]

00:58:18.190 --> 00:58:24.010
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who would like to thank all the listeners who recently pledged.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，他想感谢所有最近承诺捐款的听众。

00:58:24.010 --> 00:58:29.480
<v Man>I did make it a rule to see how much money they had in their wallet. And I was going to take all of it.
<v Man>我确实制定了一条规则，看看他们钱包里有多少钱。我要把钱全拿走。

00:58:29.480 --> 00:58:33.800
<v Wendy Dorr>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Wendy Dorr>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:33.800 --> 00:58:56.040
<v Wendy Dorr>[MUSIC PLAYING - "MOSES SUPPOSES" BY GENE KELLY AND DONALD O'CONNOR]
